The import-review file with each entry's `_source` written the short way
(`sr`, `verge`), as an older rowt recorded whatever `--from` was given. Applied,
its servers must be recorded under `shadowrocket` and `clash-verge` in
manual-sources.tsv, the names `--from shadowrocket` and `--from clash-verge`
write, so a later `--replace` from either spelling finds them.
